#: data/json/items/magazine/545x39.json
msgid ""
"Originally built to feed Soviet RPK-74 light machine guns, this curved "
"45-round box magazine possesses an aggressive waffle texture pattern and also"
" fits other Kalashnikov-based long guns, namely the AK-74 and modern civilian"
" legal variants."
